0..77 Comment "// What a kept view may not do: a view no region keeps escapes its access, an"
78..155 Comment "// exclusive view is kept nowhere, a held value a live region keeps a view of"
156..235 Comment "// is not written, and nothing kept in a region leaves it, whether a capability"
236..294 Comment "// scope or a hold opened the region. A region is a static"
295..373 Comment "// extent erased before anything runs (Koronkevich and Bowman, _Type Universes"
374..428 Comment "// as Kripke Worlds_, ICFP 2025, doi:10.1145/3747532)."
